% VERIFIED 2026-09-04 (arXiv abstract page + full-text HTML v1). Two separate
% results, do not merge: (i) SIMULATION (abstract, Table III): DC-QAOA recovers
% the exact optimum on 8 of 11 targets at 10 qubits, mean AR 0.94, 52% exact.
% (ii) HARDWARE (full text, Table IV, not the abstract): backend ibm_rensselaer
